    "bubbles": "Refractive spherical interfaces, Fresnel rims, directional reflections, bright white glints. Premultiplied alpha uses replay ABR1 ONE/SRC_ALPHA; precise feedback shader composes the equivalent live-destination mix. Original native GP0/VRAM and actor trajectories unchanged.",
    "bubble_layouts": "Connected luminous silhouettes extracted from local opening PCX awa_1/2/3, yielding 6/12/25 centers/radii. Authenticated bubble_p/bub_d_sn/splash2 owners select the original layout; other single-bubble actors keep one sphere.",
    "plume_snapshot": "Consecutive bubbles share one immutable color/depth reference per draw buffer; alpha still composes on live color. Any intervening optical group or ordinary write invalidates reuse.",
    "snow": "Unchanged; approved screenshot from previous build reused."
